      "heading": "Witnesses and evidence",
      "id": "P003",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Lemuel G. Ortoño, Assistant Secretary and Assistant Chief of Staff of the Office of the Vice President, testified that he signed four Land Bank checks and accompanied special disbursing officer Gina F. Acosta when they were encashed. He also helped prepare OVP audit replies, but lacked personal knowledge of the actual spending and submitted sealed protective-intelligence reports without reading them."
    },
