      "heading": "Witnesses and evidence",
      "id": "P005",
      "kind": "finding",
      "text": "Ortoño said the medical-and-food-aid support he saw consisted of acknowledgement receipts rather than official receipts. He also testified that Gina F. Acosta requested a ₱150,000 emergency advance relayed by Colonel Raymond Dante Lachica, that he was never reimbursed, and that the advance did not appear in OVP records."
    },
